<section class="section container" id="craft">
  <div class="craft">
    <div class="craft__body">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>
        Our Craft
      </p>
      <h2 class="section-title" data-reveal>
        Every stitch carries
        <br>
        <em>a signature</em>
      </h2>
      <div class="craft__copy" data-reveal>
        <p>
          Shrujan began in 1969 with Chanda Shroff, known as Kaki, who went to Kutch after a famine and found women whose embroidery was extraordinary and whose earnings were not. She turned that skill into a livelihood.
        </p>
        <p>
          From her vision to the hands of thousands of women across Kutch, Shrujan has quietly safeguarded the region&rsquo;s living craft traditions for over five decades, preserving the knowledge and the dignity behind it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <a class="arrow-link craft__link" href="/pages/video" data-reveal>
        Explore the Craft <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12h15"></path><path d="m13.5 6.5 5.5 5.5-5.5 5.5"></path></svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="craft__gallery" data-reveal>
      <figure class="craft__shot">
        <div class="craft__shot-media" data-parallax>
          <img src="{{ 'bottom-left.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Master weaver working threads at his handloom" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <figcaption>At the loom, Bhujodi</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="craft__shot">
        <div class="craft__shot-media">
          <img src="{{ 'top-right.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Artisan hand embroidering mirror-work flowers with a fine needle" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <figcaption>Suf, stitched from the reverse</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="craft__stats" data-reveal-child>
    <div class="stat">
      <p class="stat__value">1969</p>
      <p class="stat__label">Founded by Chanda Shroff</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <p class="stat__value">5</p>
      <p class="stat__label">Decades of craft revival</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <p class="stat__value">12</p>
      <p class="stat__label">Living craft traditions</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <p class="stat__value">4,000+</p>
      <p class="stat__label">Artisan women at work</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
